1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,099
Then how did you play it

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:02,153
so well just now?

3
00:00:03,545 --> 00:00:05,755
I kept practicing at home.

4
00:00:05,755 --> 00:00:07,382
Until it felt natural.

5
00:00:07,882 --> 00:00:09,217
But it's still

6
00:00:09,217 --> 00:00:11,094
not perfect.

7
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:12,846
What's driving you this hard?

8
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:14,222
We're in this together.

9
00:00:15,557 --> 00:00:16,975
I don't want to ruin

10
00:00:16,975 --> 00:00:18,121
your performance

11
00:00:18,122 --> 00:00:19,122
because of me.

12
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,311
I really

13
00:00:20,311 --> 00:00:21,646
like your piano.

14
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:28,194
When I first came here
I saw you perform

15
00:00:28,194 --> 00:00:29,194
and thought

16
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:30,822
“Wow

17
00:00:31,364 --> 00:00:33,033
it's so amazing.

18
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,242
I want to play like that too.”

19
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:36,411
Why are you saying that?

20
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:37,411
I even...

21
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:38,871
You...

22
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:41,791
Why are you so kind?

23
00:00:42,375 --> 00:00:43,543
But

24
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:45,670
I need this scholarship.

25
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,090
I need to practice harder.

26
00:00:51,051 --> 00:00:52,469
By the way, is your hand okay?

27
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,393
I noticed it

28
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:01,728
