29
00:01:02,353 --> 00:01:03,353
Mind your own business.

30
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:05,140
Don't push yourself too hard.

31
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:07,192
Are you

32
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:08,777
pitying me?

33
00:01:08,777 --> 00:01:11,029
No, it's not that.

34
00:01:11,029 --> 00:01:11,714
Then sit down

35
00:01:11,715 --> 00:01:12,715
and let's practice.

36
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:14,240
That's how you can help me.

37
00:01:15,658 --> 00:01:16,446
What's your relationship

38
00:01:16,447 --> 00:01:17,447
with Professor Tae-seong?
